[2026-05-09T21:10] [v1.0] init proj. tgt: legacy hub reimplementation. Kotlin/Compose. RoomDB. NotifListenerService.
[2026-05-09T21:55] [v1.1] UI tweaks. name -> Conduit. MD3 design applied. gen & add custom app icon.
[2026-05-09T22:00] [v1.2] add EMAIL chan support. use PackageManager to fetch orig app icons dyn. filter sys/bg notifs. setup gradle copyApkToOutputs.
[2026-05-09T22:15] [v1.2] setup docs versioning & caveman log rules. add timestamps.
[2026-05-09T22:25] [v1.3] deep linking impl. ui broadcasts click intent. svc checks activeNotifs -> fires PendingIntent (msg) or falls back to PackageManager app launch (inbox). destructive DB mig.
[2026-05-09T22:30] [v1.4] fix bug: pending intent silent fail. Android BAL (Background Activity Launch) restriction blocked the bg service receiver from firing intent. moved logic to MainActivity (foreground). svc now exposes static instance.
[2026-05-09T22:35] [v1.4] BUG STILL PRESENT. PendingIntent still silently failing from foreground. Pausing deep link work for now.
[2026-05-09T22:40] [v1.5] add Settings UI. simple enum state navigation. use SharedPreferences for persistent theme selection (0=Sys, 1=Light, 2=Dark). dynamicColor applied strictly based on choice.
[2026-05-10T18:55] [v1.6] add SNAPCHAT channel. detect com.snapchat.android pkg. route to AppIcon dynamic loading alongside EMAIL.
[2026-05-10T19:00] [v1.7] added filter for Snapchat's 'updating messages' bg notification.
[2026-05-10T19:07] [v1.8] add LINKEDIN channel. detect com.linkedin.android pkg. route to AppIcon dynamic loading.
[2026-05-10T19:15] [v1.9] add Channel toggles in Settings. UI filters active list if historic hidden. background svc explicitly checks SharedPreferences to block toggled-off pkgs.
[2026-05-10T19:20] [v1.10] add dynamic appName subtitle to NotificationItem via PackageManager.
[2026-05-10T19:25] [v1.11] add Inline Reply for SMS. RemoteInput extraction from activeNotifs. forged Intent injection via PendingIntent.send(). expandable UI in NotificationItem.
[2026-05-10T19:35] [v1.12] add Compose FAB to HubScreen. ModalBottomSheet for app selection. Intent ACTION_SENDTO for SMS/Email, package launch for Snapchat/LinkedIn.
[2026-05-10T20:28] [v1.13] add queries block to AndroidManifest.xml for Android 11+ Package Visibility. fixes Snapchat/LinkedIn deep linking and compose fallback.
[2026-05-10T20:45] [v1.14] add Archive feature. HubNotification schema bumped to v4 (destructive migration). added SwipeToDismiss in HubScreen. added ArchiveScreen. hid Reply in archived views.
[2026-05-10T21:05] [v1.15] add Floating Notification Dock. Material 3 bottom Surface with grouped unread badges. filtering state added to LazyColumn. SMS channel now uses native AppIcon.
[2026-05-10T22:15] [v1.16] add chronological date grouping. LazyColumn upgraded with ExperimentalFoundationApi stickyHeaders. HubScreen and ArchiveScreen updated.
[2026-05-10T22:25] [v1.17] add Snooze feature. bi-directional SwipeToDismiss added (Right=Archive, Left=Snooze). custom Material 3 Snooze Bottom Sheet hooks into Android's native NotificationListenerService.snoozeNotification.
[2026-05-10T22:30] [v1.18] add Snooze Indicators. database schema bumped to v5. added isSnoozed flag to HubNotification. updated Archive UI to show orange Snoozed label instead of red Archived label.
[2026-05-10T22:40] [v1.19] add System Notification Sync. bi-directional synchronization between Conduit archives and native System tray dismissals. added "Sync Dismissal" toggle in SettingsScreen.
[2026-05-10T22:50] [v1.20] add Quick Notes FAB. stacked multi-FAB layout using Material 3 guidelines. adds Notes menu bottom sheet for Google Keep and Notion. (Note: using Primary color for now, can be updated to tertiary later).
[2026-05-10T22:55] [v1.21] fix Notes launch bug by adding `<queries>` to AndroidManifest. fix back navigation bug by adding BackHandler intercept for sub-screens.
[2026-05-10T23:00] [v1.22] add AI Assistants FAB. expands the stacked multi-FAB layout with a new Star icon FAB. adds AI menu bottom sheet for Claude and Gemini. adds corresponding `<queries>` to AndroidManifest.
[2026-05-11T13:15] [v1.23] add Recorder FAB. expands the stacked multi-FAB layout with a PlayArrow icon FAB. directly launches Google Recorder without a submenu. adds corresponding `<queries>` to AndroidManifest.
[2026-05-11T13:38] [v1.24] increase notification text preview from 2 lines to 6 lines in NotificationItem.
[2026-05-11T13:42] [v1.25] tighten notification text line spacing. added lineHeight = 18.sp (down from default ~20sp) for a more compact look.
[2026-05-11T13:44] [v1.26] add subtle M3 dividers between notification items. 0.5dp outlineVariant Divider in both HubScreen and ArchiveScreen.
[2026-05-11T13:48] [v1.27] add INSTAGRAM channel. detect com.instagram.android pkg. route to AppIcon. added channel toggle in Settings. added `<queries>` to AndroidManifest.
[2026-05-11T13:51] [v1.28] add PHONE channel. detect com.google.android.dialer, com.android.dialer, com.samsung.android.dialer pkgs. route to AppIcon. added "Phone Calls" toggle in Settings.
[2026-05-11T22:25] [v1.29] upgrade SMS Reply from TextButton to M3 AssistChip. add "Mark Read" AssistChip that discovers native mark-read action from notification actions array, fires it, then archives locally.
[2026-05-11T22:36] [v1.30] extend Reply and Mark Read AssistChips to EMAIL channel (Spark). expanded visibility condition from SMS-only to SMS || EMAIL.
[2026-05-11T22:49] [v1.31] add "View Archive" AssistChip to empty Hub state. replaces old placeholder text with a clean M3 chip that navigates directly to the Archive screen.
[2026-05-11T23:00] [v1.32] rename "Hide Historic Notifications" to "Enable Channel Filters". added subtitle explaining functionality: "When enabled, only notifications from toggled-on channels below will appear in the Hub".
[2026-05-11T23:11] [v1.33] reorganize Settings. moved "Sync Dismissal with System" into its own "Sync" section with description subtitle. Channels section now cleanly contains filter toggle + channel switches only.
[2026-05-11T23:30] [FUTURE IDEAS] home screen widget, edge panel/sidebar (legacy hub style), smart grouping, quick reply to any app, action discovery & surfacing, customizable FAB stack.
[2026-05-11T23:38] [v1.34] add Pinned Notifications. DB schema v6 (isPinned flag, destructive migration). long-press to pin/unpin. pinned items float above date groups with star icon header. pin indicator star next to title. timestamp shows shorthand date (M/d · h:mm a) for pinned items. added Developer section in Settings with "Generate Test Notifications" (13 fake notifs across all 6 channels) and "Clear All Notifications" buttons.
[2026-05-11T23:45] [v1.34 FIX] Settings screen not scrollable — Developer section hidden below viewport. added verticalScroll(rememberScrollState()) to Settings Column. also added rememberScrollState and verticalScroll imports.
[2026-05-11T23:48] [v1.34 FIX] Long-press to pin not working — outer combinedClickable wrapper was blocked by NotificationItem's inner .clickable consuming touch events. fix: moved long-press handling into NotificationItem itself by converting .clickable to .combinedClickable(onClick, onLongClick). added onPinNotification param to NotificationItem. added @OptIn(ExperimentalFoundationApi) annotation.
[2026-05-11T23:54] [v1.34 TWEAK] increased long-press timeout to 700ms using LocalViewConfiguration override in HubScreen. replaced Star icon with PushPin for pinned notifications.
[2026-05-12T20:25] [v1.35] add Bulk Actions. introduced multi-selection mode triggered by tapping app icon/avatar. added Contextual Action Bar with batch Archive, Pin, and Mark Read. row-wide click selection when active. checkmark UI feedback.
[2026-05-12T20:31] [v1.35 FIX] Selection hit target misaligned. expanded selection Box to fill row height using IntrinsicSize.Min and increased width to 60dp. ensured selection area captures vertical padding region.
[2026-05-12T20:34] [v1.35 FIX] Fixed multi-selection blocking. The icon Box clickable modifier was consuming touches even when disabled. enabled it permanently to allow selection toggling and prevent event blocking.
[2026-05-12T20:42] [v1.36] add Swipe Gesture Animations. enhanced SwipeToDismiss background with scaling icons and text labels. integrated animateItemPlacement with spring physics for smooth list reordering when items are dismissed. updated Archive and Pinned sections to support placement animations.
[2026-05-12T20:46] [v1.36 TWEAK] improved selection ripple aesthetics. switched to unbounded circular ripple for the icon/avatar area with a 32dp radius. removes the rectangular clipping and makes the interaction feel more centered on the visual element.
[2026-05-12T20:49] [v1.37] add Haptic Feedback. integrated granular Pixel-style haptics using native Vibrator/VibrationEffect APIs. added TICKS for selection/FABs and CLICKS for batch actions/long-press. implemented threshold haptics for swiping using LaunchedEffect observing dismissState.targetValue.
[2026-05-12T20:51] [v1.37 FIX] App crash on haptic triggers. Missing VIBRATE permission in AndroidManifest.xml. Added the required permission to allow system service access.
[2026-05-12T21:09] [v1.38] add Global Notification Search. unified search bar in HubScreen that queries both active and archived notifications. introduced ARCHIVED badge for visual distinction in search results. archived results use muted background opacity. results sorted by timestamp (newest first). added haptic transitions and back-handling for search mode.
[2026-05-12T21:15] [v1.39] add Quick Reply. integrated Android RemoteInput API to allow direct inline replies. added getReplyAction helper to Service. implemented expandable TextField with smooth AnimatedVisibility transitions in NotificationItem. successfully sends reply and auto-archives notification locally.
[2026-05-12T21:22] [v1.40] add Action Discovery & Surfacing. dynamically scans all native notification actions and displays them as AssistChips using FlowRow. implemented generic triggerNotificationAction helper with intelligent auto-archive for read/archive/delete keywords. cleaned up legacy reply UI code. unified inline reply triggers with discovery logic.
[2026-05-13T20:26] [v1.41] address sensitive notification redaction (Android 15+). added RECEIVE_SENSITIVE_NOTIFICATIONS permission to manifest. this allows reading OTPs and bank messages if the permission is granted via ADB. added workaround documentation for the user.
[2026-05-13T20:31] [v1.42] rename package from com.conduit.app to com.conduit.app. updated namespace and applicationId in build.gradle.kts. moved source files to new directory structure. updated all package statements and internal imports. cleaned up legacy directory structure.
[2026-05-13T20:35] [v1.43] complete rebrand. renamed rootProject to Conduit. updated Themes, Compose Theme functions, SharedPreferences keys, and Database file names from conduit/conduit to Conduit/conduit. project is now fully rebranded internally and externally.
[NOTE] To allow Conduit to read OTPs and sensitive bank messages on Android 15+, run: adb shell appops set --user 0 com.conduit.app RECEIVE_SENSITIVE_NOTIFICATIONS allow
[2026-05-13T21:11] [v1.44] add Adaptive Icon. hand-coded Vector Drawable for foreground based on user design (Square + 8-pointed star). implemented background layer with Conduit deep-charcoal (#1A1A1A). updated Manifest to use @mipmap/ic_launcher and added roundIcon support. removed legacy PNG assets.
[2026-05-13T22:14] [v1.45] implement Customizable FAB Stack. added FabAction model and persistent storage in conduit_prefs. implemented Long-Press interaction to trigger customization bottom sheet. added System Actions (Archive All, Search) as selectable options. updated HubScreen to dynamically render the FAB stack based on user preference.
[2026-05-13T22:16] [v1.46] bugfix: FAB click interception. replaced FloatingActionButton with a manual Surface implementation to ensure Modifier.combinedClickable correctly handles both single clicks and long-presses without internal interception.
[2026-05-13T22:21] [v1.47] implement Expandable/Collapsible FAB Stack. added Master Toggle button with persistent isFabExpanded state. integrated AnimatedVisibility for smooth slide/fade transitions. added contextual hiding logic to automatically remove the FAB stack during Selection or Search modes for better focus.
[2026-05-13T22:25] [v1.48] refine FAB expansion animation. switched from slideInVertically to expandVertically/shrinkVertically anchored to the bottom. this makes the stack appear to emerge directly from the toggle button rather than sliding in from the screen edge.
[2026-05-13T22:27] [v1.49] fix FAB ripple clipping. added .clip(MaterialTheme.shapes.large) to all manual FAB and toggle surfaces. this ensures ripple effects correctly respect the rounded corners instead of bleeding into a full square.
[2026-05-13T22:32] [v1.50] fix Dock/FAB overlap. wrapped Floating Dock in a Box with 88dp end-padding to reserve space for the FAB stack. converted Dock to LazyRow to safely handle horizontal overflow when many apps have active notifications. cleaned up shadowed variables in SwipeToDismiss logic.
[2026-05-13T22:34] [v1.51] fix dock centering & badge clipping. switched to symmetric horizontal padding (88dp) to keep dock perfectly centered while protecting both screen corners. disabled clipToPadding on LazyRow and increased item padding to ensure notification count badges are fully visible without truncation.
[2026-05-13T22:38] [v1.52] implemented Customizable App Bundles. replaced hardcoded AI, Notes, and Compose menus with a dynamic Bundle system. added  App Bundles section in Settings with full app picker to configure category contents. implemented intelligent launch logic: FAB launches app directly if bundle has 1 item, or opens a menu if multiple items are present.
[2026-05-13T22:47] [v1.53] Upgraded App Bundles UI to premium M3 standards. added card-based organization in Settings, a dedicated  Add App button in the editor, and a searchable App Picker with icons and selection states.
[2026-05-14T10:25] [v1.54] fixed App Bundle editing bug. refactored editing state to be reactive (deriving from actual bundle states rather than a static snapshot). this fixes real-time UI updates when deleting apps and ensures app additions persist correctly.
[2026-05-14T10:32] [v1.55] reduced Floating Dock height by tightening vertical padding in LazyRow and container modifier.
[2026-05-14T10:38] [v1.56] implemented Compact Mode. added toggle in TopAppBar (Hub & Archive) to switch between detailed and high-density views. compact mode truncates text to single line, hides app name labels, and removes all action chips/replies for a denser list layout.
[2026-05-14T10:42] [v1.57] adjusted Compact Mode spacing. increased vertical padding from 4dp to 8dp for better legibility while maintaining a high-density layout.
[2026-05-14T10:44] [v1.58] polished Compact Mode transitions. added animateContentSize to NotificationItem for smooth height morphing and Crossfade to the TopAppBar toggle icon.
[2026-05-14T10:48] [v1.59] optimized Compact Mode performance and fixed squashed layouts. converted static IF checks for expanded content to AnimatedVisibility blocks with expand/shrink transitions. refined animateContentSize with a low-stiffness spring for smoother height morphing.
[2026-05-14T10:52] [v1.60] optimized compaction logic for better responsiveness. simplified transition logic by removing AnimatedVisibility overhead in favor of a single lightweight animateContentSize on the inner content Column. switched to a 200ms tween for faster, snappier height transitions.
[2026-05-14T10:57] [v1.61] synchronized list-wide compaction animations. introduced a shared compactFactor (0.0 to 1.0) passed from the screen level to all NotificationItems. items now use lerp and alpha-blending driven by this factor, ensuring that even newly composed items entering the viewport are perfectly in sync with the ongoing transition.
[2026-05-14T11:18] [v1.63] high-performance morphing. replaced expensive AnimatedVisibility nodes with lightweight if/else logic and switched all list animations (placement and content size) to 300ms tweens. this drastically reduces CPU pressure during density shifts while maintaining visual smoothness through animateContentSize.
[2026-05-14T18:13] [v1.64] optimized Compact Mode logic. refactored from float-based frame-by-frame lerping to a boolean-driven state model. replaced complex lerp calculations with high-performance AnimatedVisibility and animateContentSize blocks, eliminating UI-thread jank during density shifts.
[2026-05-14T18:13] [v1.65] fixed code duplication & build errors. resolved structural duplication in MainActivity.kt caused by failed multi-replace operations. removed all legacy compactProgress float references and synchronized item parameters across Hub and Archive screens.
[2026-05-14T18:31] [v1.66] full rollback of Compact Mode. removed all expand/collapse buttons, state management, and density-shifting logic based on user feedback. restored NotificationItem to a stable, single-density expanded layout. retained performance-critical appLabelCache for list smoothness.
[2026-05-15T00:32] [v1.67] fix Action Chip squashing & empty pills. removed IntrinsicSize.Min constraints from NotificationItem rows to prevent vertical clipping on long notifications. expanded action discovery to include Android 10+ Contextual Actions (Smart Replies). added title-validation to prevent empty/whitespace chips.
[2026-05-17T17:48] [v1.68] fixed LazyColumn scrolling lag. Eliminated UI-thread blocking IPC calls to `getActiveNotifications` by caching `Notification.Action`s in `HubNotificationListenerService`. Offloaded synchronous `PackageManager` lookups (app icons and app labels) in `AppIcon` and `NotificationItem` to background coroutines via `LaunchedEffect`. Introduced global `appIconCache` to prevent re-fetching and re-converting icons.
[2026-05-17T17:53] [v1.69] fixed Action Chips layout popping during scroll. Reverted `NotificationItem` action lookups (`allActions` and `replyAction`) from asynchronous `LaunchedEffect` to synchronous `remember` blocks. Because `actionCache` in the service is now instantaneous, synchronous lookup no longer blocks the UI thread, but it guarantees chips are present during the very first layout pass, eliminating the visual "expansion" effect.
[2026-05-17T18:09] [v1.70] added native android bubbles support. configured mainactivity to be embeddable and resizeable in androidmanifest.xml. implemented dynamic shortcut creation (shortcutmanagercompat) and bubblemetadata registration in hubnotificationlistenerservice.kt to automatically trigger native conversation floating bubbles for intercepted messaging channels. included future-proof boolean flag 'dismiss_original_notifications' to optionally auto-cancel duplicate stock notifications.
[2026-05-17T18:14] [v1.70 FIX] fixed bubble setting visibility on android 13+. Added POST_NOTIFICATIONS uses-permission to manifest and requested it at runtime in MainActivity onCreate. This ensures Android recognises the app as notification-enabled, enabling System Bubbles and standard notification preferences for Conduit.
[2026-05-17T18:17] [v1.70.2] fixed bubble action button tap doing nothing. updated dynamic shortcut creation in hubnotificationlistenerservice.kt to set the conversation category ('android.shortcut.conversation') and fallback app icon via iconcompat. updated createbubblemetadata to use the modern, shortcut-based bubblemetadata builder. this ensures android correctly links the bubble activity to a valid conversation shortcut, enabling fluid overlay rendering when tapped.
[2026-05-17T18:22] [v1.70.3] customized bubble icons to display the icon of the sending application. updated postBubbleNotification in hubnotificationlistenerservice.kt to resolve the source package's app icon drawable via packagemanager, convert it to a 192x192 bitmap via drawable.toBitmap, and apply it to both the dynamic shortcut info and the messaging style person structure. this replaces the default conduit launcher icon with the sender app's visual identity (e.g. snapchat, gmail, sms) on both the floating bubble overlay and the notification detail badge.
[2026-05-18T20:14] [v1.71.0] implemented custom notification block/filter rules. added a Block similar notifications icon (Icons.Filled.Block) to the Hub selection mode top bar, triggering a custom AlertDialog dialog options popup where the user can choose to block future notifications matching the selected item's Title or Content Text. matched blocked criteria automatically on incoming notifications within HubNotificationListenerService.kt (ignoring them instantly), and bulk-archived all pre-existing matches currently in the database to clear the feed. integrated an Ignored Notifications settings section in SettingsScreen listing all configured filters with dynamic app icons/labels and custom delete buttons to easily remove them. added getActiveNotificationsSync to NotificationDao.kt to query active unarchived records. bump versionCode to 74.
[2026-05-18T20:20] [v1.71.1] fixed block button not working when selecting archived notifications from the Hub search results list. updated the Block action in MainActivity.kt to search the selected item across both active `notifications` and `archivedNotifications` collections. this ensures the matching block criteria dialog triggers properly for selected archived search items. bump versionCode to 75.
[2026-05-18T20:25] [v1.72.0] added sensitive notification access permission notice card in SettingsScreen. designed a premium "Advanced Security & OTPs" settings card explaining Android 15+ notification redacting behavior for OTPs and bank alerts, showing the specific ADB command required to grant full read permission, and integrating a clipboard copy button with haptic feedback and custom toast confirmation for excellent user convenience. bump versionCode to 76.
[2026-05-18T20:29] [v1.73.0] added interactive conversation bubble setup notice card in SettingsScreen. designed a step-by-step "Conversation Bubbles" tutorial card explaining native Android bubble capabilities. made postBubbleNotification a public method inside HubNotificationListenerService.kt and added a "Send Test Bubble" button to trigger dynamic testing bubbles for first-time launch. integrated an "Open Bubble Settings" button to link directly to Conduit's app settings/bubbles channel within Android OS. bump versionCode to 77.
[2026-05-18T20:34] [v1.74.0] added MessagingStyle self-reply interception support. updated HubNotificationListenerService.kt to extract history logs via Notification.EXTRA_MESSAGES and detect if the last message sender was ourselves (null, selfDisplayName, or "You"). if identified as a reply, we query for the most recent active/archived matching feed record via getMostRecentByTitleAndPackage in NotificationDao.kt, append the curved-arrow response suffix ("\n↳ You: <text>") in-place, and unarchive it cleanly via updateAndUnarchive, returning early to prevent posting duplicate cards. bump versionCode to 78.
[2026-05-18T20:50] [v1.75.0] added layout "Compact mode" feature toggle. integrated an interactive top bar Density icon button next to the search button in HubScreen to toggle layout modes. persisted layout preference across app restarts under 'compact_mode' SharedPreferences key. modified AppIcon Composable to accept a dynamic custom size parameter. redesigned NotificationItem to conditionally adjust vertical column padding (4.dp vs 12.dp), shrink checkmark/avatar containers (36.dp vs 50.dp), decrease name text dimensions, limit body message preview (2 vs 6 maxLines), and fully hide native action chips when compact mode is enabled. bump versionCode to 79.
[2026-05-18T21:06] [v1.75.1 TWEAK] updated compact mode toggle icons to arrows pointing towards each other (Icons.Filled.Compress) for entering compact mode and arrows pointing away (Icons.Filled.Expand) for exiting compact mode. bump versionCode to 80.
[2026-05-18T21:09] [v1.75.2 TWEAK] resolved top app bar layout compact toggle icon color discrepancy. switched default tint from hardcoded white to LocalContentColor.current to exactly inherit standard tinted blue of search/archive/settings actions, and switched active tint from bright primary to secondary for a softer highlighted look. bump versionCode to 81.
[2026-05-18T21:16] [v1.76.0] added "Jacob Mode (AMOLED)" pitch-black layout theme. introduced theme selection index 3 mapping to pitch-black (#000000) background, surface, and surfaceVariant. integrated a dynamic "Monochrome Accents" switcher visible only in Jacob Mode, letting users force high-contrast pure white/light gray elements instead of dynamic monet colored brand blue accents. persisted all preferences in SharedPreferences. bump versionCode to 82.
[2026-05-18T21:24] [v1.76.1 TWEAK] optimized self-reply intercept and formatting layout. updated getMostRecentByTitleAndPackage to match titles ending in " - Replied". updated HubNotificationListenerService.kt to append " - Replied" suffix to notification title on response. styled "\u21aa You:" prefix in NotificationItem text body using a bold primary color span, and styled the reply text in italics for high readability. bump versionCode to 83.
[2026-05-18T21:29] [v1.76.2 TWEAK] re-ordered App Bundles in Settings screen to Recorder, AI Assistants, Notes, Compose, matching user preference. added matching FAB system icons (PlayArrow, Star, List, Edit) themed with MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primary to the left of each bundle's list title. bump versionCode to 84.
[2026-05-18T21:37] [v1.77.0] implemented Floating Dock unread app icon long-press launch gesture. integrated combinedClickable gesture detection inside LazyRow items in MainActivity.kt. resolved package-specific launch intent via PackageManager and safely dispatched launch activity with premium haptic vibration and user-friendly error toasts. designed an "Unread App Dock Settings" settings section in SettingsScreen featuring a persistent "Launch App on Long Press" Switch toggle backed by SharedPreferences. bump versionCode to 85.
[2026-05-18T21:40] [v1.77.1 TWEAK] resolved Floating Dock unread app icon notification badge layout cutoff regression. removed parent Box .clip(CircleShape) modifier that was restricting layout drawing bounds, restoring full rendering of red notification count badges floating on the top-right. bump versionCode to 86.
[2026-05-18T21:51] [v1.78.0] implemented Native Android Pinning Sync feature. intercepted Conduit pinned notifications to dismiss the original system notification via HubNotificationListenerService. created a new conduit_pinned notification channel to post indestructible permanent clones directly into the Android system tray. added "Sync Pinned Notifications" toggle in SettingsScreen backed by SharedPreferences. updated onPinNotification signatures to handle full HubNotification objects instead of just IDs to support full metadata copying for clones. bump versionCode to 87.
[2026-05-22T07:30] [v1.78.1 TWEAK] fixed pinning sync archive regression. updated archiveNotificationByKey in NotificationDao to only archive notifications where isPinned = 0. this prevents the act of natively replacing a system notification from automatically throwing the notification into the archive view in the app. bump versionCode to 88.
[2026-05-22T07:49] [v1.78.2 TWEAK] tightened up notification vertical spacing for normal (non-compact) view. reduced vertical padding inside NotificationItem's main Column from 12.dp to 8.dp to increase information density on the HubScreen. bump versionCode to 89.
[2026-05-22T08:01] [v1.78.3 TWEAK] compressed notification action chips UI. replaced the default bulky AssistChip with a custom transparent Surface chip using tighter padding and reduced horizontal/vertical spacing in the FlowRow to drastically save screen real estate while keeping text perfectly legible. bump versionCode to 90.
[2026-05-22T08:07] [v1.78.4 TWEAK] further reduced action chip layout margins. tightened horizontal and vertical arrangement inside the action FlowRow down to 4.dp to bring the custom chips even closer together and closer to the main body text. bump versionCode to 91.
[2026-05-22T08:11] [v1.78.5] added 'Show Action Chips' toggle to SettingsScreen. updated MainActivity state to persist show_action_chips preference via SharedPreferences. passed the state down through HubScreen and ArchiveScreen to NotificationItem to conditionally render the FlowRow of action chips. bump versionCode to 92.
[2026-05-22T08:23] [v1.78.6] fixed snapchat notification grouping regression. disabled MessagingStyle self-reply interception specifically for Snapchat. this stops empty sender notification payloads (like "is typing..." or "sent you a snap") from being parsed as "You:" self-replies, ensuring they post as fresh, distinct entries. bump versionCode to 93.
[2026-05-22T08:28] [v1.78.7] added new channels (Telegram, Reddit, Steam Chat). updated HubNotificationListenerService to intercept org.telegram.messenger/org.thunderdog.challegram, com.reddit.frontpage, and com.valvesoftware.android.steam.community/com.valvesoftware.steamchat packages. added corresponding switches to SettingsScreen UI to filter these channels. bump versionCode to 94.
[2026-05-22T09:58] [v1.79.0] implemented bubble notification grouping & shade suppression. added group key and summary notification (id 9999) to bubble notifications to stack them in the tray. enabled setSuppressNotification(true) to hide bubble notifications from the status bar/shade. added selectively targeted active bubble notification dismissal in MainActivity's onResume to clean up the shade on app launch. bump versionCode to 95.
[2026-05-22T10:33] [v1.79.1] fixed missing telegram/reddit/steam app icons in avatar slot and dock. added package names to AndroidManifest <queries> block so packageManager can query them. updated NotificationItem avatar check to render AppIcon for TELEGRAM, REDDIT, and STEAM channels. bump versionCode to 96.
[2026-05-22T10:59] [v1.80.0] added customizable left/right swipe gestures to notification items. created settings section under Swipe Gestures enabling choices of snooze, archive, pin/unpin, and block. updated SwipeToDismiss logic to execute dynamic actions, and updated swipe background styling with custom colors, icons, and labels. bump versionCode to 97.
[2026-05-22T12:07] [v1.80.1] fixed bubble auto-dismissal issue. implemented isRunningInBubble check using isLaunchedFromBubble (API 31+) and custom intent extra from_bubble to prevent notification cancellation inside onResume when MainActivity is running within an expanded bubble. bump versionCode to 98.
[2026-05-22T14:18] [v1.80.2] fixed phone notification interception issue. expanded isPhone check in HubNotificationListenerService to cover com.android.phone, com.android.server.telecom, com.android.contacts, packages matching .dialer or ending in .phone, and CATEGORY_CALL notifications. updated AndroidManifest queries and onResume clean up list with new packages. bump versionCode to 99.
