[2026-05-25T00:00] [v1.84.0] added bracket notification popup icon animation and settings switch. when a notification is received, the app icon slides out of the bracket with overshoot animation, handles taps on either the handle or icon to launch the notification, and retreats back under the bracket after 2 seconds.
[2026-05-25T06:12] [v1.84.1] increased the touch target area of the bracket handle from 16dp to 32dp width to make it easier to activate long-presses, without changing its visual size.
[2026-05-25T00:44] [v1.85.0] implemented bracket hanger feature with continuous drag-to-select and click-to-open gesture modes, including live blur overlay and m3 material cards.
[2026-05-25T00:56] [v1.85.1] fixed hanger notification launch failing on null intents and filtered hanger list to only supported active channels.
[2026-05-25T01:03] [v1.85.2] fixed hanger closing behavior, sorted hanger notifications chronologically, added app icon badges to hanger cards, and updated intent launch methods for background privileges.
[2026-05-25T01:13] [v1.85.3] restored pixel os blur in bracket hanger by replacing solid background with #44000000 overlay, and replaced conduit app launcher icon with a new minimalist design.
[2026-05-25T15:57] [v1.85.4] implemented 350ms duration threshold for bracket hanger gesture to distinguish swiping to open vs quick selecting, and stabilized pixel blur by configuring FLAG_BLUR_BEHIND persistently in the window manager parameters.
[2026-05-25T21:07] [v1.85.5] enabled immersive mode on hanger opening to hide system status and navigation bars, achieving a cleaner full-screen blur effect, and added back button support to close the hanger.
[2026-05-25T21:33] [v1.85.6] configured layoutInDisplayCutoutMode on the hanger window to LAYOUT_IN_DISPLAY_CUTOUT_MODE_SHORT_EDGES, allowing the immersive mode blur to physically extend all the way into the camera notch/cutout bounds where the status bar previously sat.
[2026-05-25T21:42] [v1.85.7] added bracket_vertical_position preference and a 10-step UI slider in settings to allow real-time repositioning of the bracket handle along the screen's right edge.
[2026-05-25T21:55] [v1.85.8] added FLAG_NOT_TOUCH_MODAL globally to the overlay parameters and implemented fail-safes in closeHanger to permanently prevent invisible touch-stealing dead zones. updated AndroidManifest to use singleTask launch mode to stop Conduit from spawning endless instances in the Recents menu.
Investigated touch blocking bug occurring even with hanger disabled. Hypothesized it was either fixed by the v1.85.8 global FLAG_NOT_TOUCH_MODAL failsafe, or it is a native Android SystemUI bug related to Bubbles.
[2026-05-26T21:35] [v1.85.9] stripped FLAG_LAYOUT_NO_LIMITS and LAYOUT_IN_DISPLAY_CUTOUT_MODE_SHORT_EDGES from the idle overlay state and injected them dynamically during hanger activation. this prevents a critical android 14/15 pixel OS touch matrix bug where floating windows mapped touches globally when recalculating screen bounds.
Investigating Recents animation deadlock. Found that recents_animation_input_consumer was active and covering the entire screen, preventing touches. Restarted Pixel Launcher to test if that breaks the deadlock without killing Conduit.
[2026-05-26T21:54] [v1.85.10] added explicit android 14 ActivityOptions.MODE_BACKGROUND_ACTIVITY_START_ALLOWED to all pendingintent and startactivity launch requests in hubnotificationlistenerservice to prevent the os from deadlocking into a permanently paused state when the background start is rejected.
[2026-05-26T22:00] [v1.85.11] completely removed unsafe WindowInsetsController calls from the APPLICATION_OVERLAY window bounds. dynamically toggling edge insets via an overlay while shrinking the window bounds caused the system UI inset animation machine to fatally crash in android 14, permanently blocking touches to the underlying activity.
[2026-05-26T22:15] [v1.85.12] completely removed all dynamic toggling of layout flags (FLAG_NOT_FOCUSABLE, FLAG_LAYOUT_NO_LIMITS, SHORT_EDGES, FLAG_FULLSCREEN) during open/close hanger events. dynamically toggling flags on an overlay permanently crashes android 14's inset and focus state machines. the overlay is now permanently non-focusable and relies on resizing bounds exclusively.
[2026-05-26T22:36] [v1.85.13] permanently set overlay bounds to MATCH_PARENT and implemented ViewTreeObserver.OnComputeInternalInsetsListener to dynamically update touchableRegion. this strictly adheres to AOSP overlay standards and completely resolves the Android 14 Predictive Back deadlock caused by an overlay altering its bounds mid-gesture.
[2026-05-27T07:32] [v1.85.14] refactored conduit to a two-window overlay architecture. bracketview is now statically 88x120 and never resizes, preventing predictive back gesture interruptions. hanger root is added/removed dynamically on demand.
[2026-05-27T12:50] [v1.85.15] fixed hanger visibility bug. the two-window architecture works flawlessly and the android 14 predictive back deadlock is completely neutralized.
[2026-05-27T13:14] [v1.85.16] removed FLAG_NOT_FOCUSABLE from hanger window to intercept Back button and Home swipe (via onWindowFocusChanged). added click listener to hangerLinearLayout to reliably capture taps on empty space.
[2026-05-27T13:25] [v1.85.17] intercepted ACTION_CANCEL on hangerRootView to detect and close the hanger when the system intercepts touches for gestures like swipe home.
[2026-05-27T13:38] [v1.85.18] added ACTION_CLOSE_SYSTEM_DIALOGS BroadcastReceiver to HubNotificationListenerService. this specifically catches home button presses and recents navigation to gracefully close the hanger since SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW apps are explicitly exempt from the android 12 restrictions on this broadcast.
[2026-05-27T13:42] [v1.85.19] restored FLAG_BLUR_BEHIND to hanger window layout params so that the blur radius setting actually applies to the window background.
[2026-05-27T21:55] [v1.85.20] added FLAG_LAYOUT_IN_SCREEN and layoutInDisplayCutoutMode = SHORT_EDGES to hanger params to allow the hanger window to draw into the display cutout/status bar area, enabling full screen blur.
[2026-05-28T22:27] [v1.85.21] removed setColorFilter(Color.WHITE) from the bracket popup image view so that the true application icon colors are displayed instead of a flat white silhouette.
[2026-06-01T22:23] [v1.85.22] split Bracket Window into two distinct windows: a 32dp wide Handle window and an ephemeral 40x40dp Popup Icon window. This completely eliminates touch deadzones caused by the 88dp wide static bounds.
